  "description": "Perfectly positioned in the sought-after Río Verde area of Nueva Andalucía, Casa El Palmerial offers the ideal blend of comfort, convenience, and the Marbella lifestyle. This three-bedroom, three-bathroom townhouse is located within a charming gated community, surrounded by lush tropical gardens and excellent communal facilities, making it an ideal base for families, couples, and friends alike.\n\nInside, the property combines spacious living areas with modern comforts. The bright open-plan lounge and dining area creates a welcoming atmosphere, while the fully equipped contemporary kitchen provides everything needed for a carefree stay. Large sliding doors open onto a private terrace, complete with outdoor dining facilities and a BBQ, perfect for enjoying long Mediterranean evenings with family and friends.\n\nThe townhouse is distributed over multiple levels and offers three comfortable bedrooms and three bathrooms, providing privacy and space for all guests. The master suite enjoys its own en-suite bathroom, while the upper levels feature sunny terraces where you can relax with a morning coffee or unwind after a day exploring the Costa del Sol.\n\nIn addition to the three bedrooms, the property also features an additional sleeping area on the lower ground floor. This space is accessed via an open staircase and does not have a separate door or natural daylight windows. While it is not considered a formal bedroom, it offers a comfortable extra sleeping space and benefits from its own adjacent bathroom with shower facilities, making it a practical option for guests seeking additional accommodation flexibility.\n\nOne of the highlights of the community is its beautiful pool area, surrounded by mature palm trees, landscaped gardens, sun loungers, and a separate jacuzzi, creating a peaceful oasis just moments from the vibrant energy of Nueva Andalucía.\n\nThe location is truly exceptional. Within just a few minutes' walk you will find some of Nueva Andalucía's most popular restaurants, cafés, supermarkets, tennis clubs, padel facilities, and social hotspots. The famous Puerto Banús marina, its designer boutiques, beach clubs, and nightlife are only a short drive away, while the golden beaches of Marbella can be reached in approximately five minutes.\n\nWhether you are looking for a relaxing family holiday, an active golf and padel getaway, or simply wish to experience the best of Marbella's lifestyle, Casa El Palmerial offers the perfect setting from which to enjoy it all.\n\nPlease note, we welcome families and couples only. We do not accept groups under 30, nor hen or stag parties. If you fall outside this category but would like to book, please send us an inquiry with more details about your group, and we can consider your request.\n\nWe look forward to welcoming you!",
